You might say, our life does not have much meaning. So it might feel useless. The amount of suffering one human causes to another, human or non-human, almost make it seem like being born is worthless.
But I find meaning in spreading happiness and giving a good life to as many people as possible. 
You bring up a child from its young age to adulthood, mentor it, guide it, teach it how to be a human, how to operate thru life; that noble work by itself will be a meaning of your life.
Listen, the life will seem meaningless if there's just suffering in this earth. So terraform the earth into a paradise. Make that a goal of your life. You'll see future humans will find their life to be a lot more meaningful. Maybe you will not be alive to see that day, but if we don't start who will? 
The choice is mine... ours. Either we push the earth towards a paradise or make more people feel life is useless.
